{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm, iterative, O(V + E)."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"StronglyConnectedComponents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/StronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L147"},"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components are in the order Tarjan’s algorithm completes them, on a depth-first search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with roots in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order and successors in "},{"code":"successors(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order (the order of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"NetworkX, petgraph and Boost). That is a reverse topological order of the condensation:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every edge between components goes from a later component to an earlier one, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"reversed()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the components with every edge going forward. Each component lists its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":", so on a graph whose vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions are insertion order ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StableDirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"), one sort by that vertex’s position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"puts the components in insertion order, O(C log C) for C components:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On any graph, one pass over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, O(V):"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let components = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","let inVertexOrder = graph.vertices.compactMap { vertex in","    let component = components[components.component(of: vertex)]","    return component.first == vertex ? component : nil","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/stronglyConnectedComponents()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm, iterative, O(V + E)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/Components":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A partition of a graph’s vertices into components, in a documented order: a collection of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, each a slice of vertices in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order, with an O(1) "},{"code":"component(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Components"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","title":"Components","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/components","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Components"}]},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","title":"Connectivity","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"abstract":[],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","kind":"symbol","title":"DirectedGraph","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P"}]},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","title":"GraphProtocols"}}}